2 TITL Kemp Family Cemetery Iredell, NC With family history from earliest settler John Kemp, son Squire, grandson Joseph Kemp
3 CONT John Kemp purchased land on Brushy Creek in 1794.  Kemp Family Cemetery New Hope Township, NC is located on this property. Most headstones are obscured.
3 CONT 
3 CONT Squire (Esquire) Kemp attended Grassy Knob Baptist Church, North Iredell & may find more records there.  Squire Kemp purchased land from heirs of John Kemp accumulating >1400 acres for farming, etc. Squire Kemp listed his 14 children in his will, l
3 CONC eaving home place to youngest son, Joseph Kemp.  Joseph Kemp's will included 440 acres with original homestead. Grandson of John Kemp's headstone is readable: Joseph Kemp's  Born: ca 1822 died 1902. 
3 CONT  Pages filed with Register of Deeds Iredell County
