2 PAGE John Foster, born 7 Oct 1642 in Weymouth, Massachusetts, a blacksmith, married in about 1663 in Marshfield, Massachusetts to Mary Chillingsworth, born 1642, daughter of Thomas Chillingsworth & Joanna in Marshfield, Massachusetts, British Colonial A
3 CONC merica.  
3 CONT [Note that a Find A Grave source is attached which has incorrectly placed the 7 Oct 1642 birth date which is documented for her husband John Foster, as the birth date for Mary; Also note that the Gravestone has only names and no dates are listed o
3 CONC n the Gravestone.  Information in the Chillingsworth family places the birth of Mary in 1642.]
3 CONT 
3 CONT (The link under the Web page heading above goes to the source for this marriage which is under person 3 in the bottom paragraph of this page 395.)
3 CONT 
3 CONT (This same page 395 also lists further information in a footnote at the bottom of the page on Thomas Chillingsworth and his wife Joanna, noting that they had 4 daughters but no son.  All 4 daughters, Elizabeth, Mehitabel, Mary and Sarah, are liste
3 CONC d with their marriages, likely in birth order, in this footnote.)
