2 TITL Abigail Parker and John Marshall.pdf
3 CONT Abigail (Parker) Marshall is my 7th great-grandmother. She was born in Billerica, MA on 11 Sep 1698 to Benjamin & Abigail (French) Parker. Abigail Parker married John Marshall on 15 Aug 1722 in Charlestown, MA. They had 5 children, John (died age 1
3 CONC 7 days), John (1724-1775) who married Deborah Reed, Daniel (1726-1809) who married Rachel Greenley, Abigail (died age 4 months), David (died age 1 month). This relationship between Abigail and John is documented in various places including the Hist
3 CONC ory of Billerica, Massachusetts by Rev. Henry A. Hazen published in 1883. Excerpts of the Genealogical Register for the Parkers and the Marshalls are included below. The Massachusetts Vital Records from 1620 – 1850 also support this relationshi
3 CONC p and screen shots are provided in this attachment.
