3 CONT Documentation is on page 4. Spouses of some of the children are listed in the documentation. There is an additional child on this form, child #4 Elizabeth Metcalf born 4 August 1625. Child #5 is Elizabeth Metcalf christened on 20 September 1626. Th
3 CONC ere is a different death date of 11 May instead of 1 April 1711 for Elizabeth Metcalf, child #i7. There is also a slight birth date difference on Thomas Metcalf, child #9. Child #4, John Metcalf has a birth date of 5 September 1622 on this form an
3 CONC d 15 May 1622 on familysearch. There is a large difference on the death date of this child, John Metcalf on this form it is 27 November 1675 and familysearch lists his death date as 8 October 1690. This is a large difference. There is a differenc
3 CONC e on the name of the spouse of Martha Metcalf. This form lists the spouse as William Brignall and familysearch lists Bickner. There I also a difference in the name of the spouse of Thomas Metcalf. This form lists Sarah Page and familysearch has he
3 CONC r a Sarah Pidge. 
