2 PAGE Last Will & Testament of John Freeman, dated the 1st of June, 1716, at Eastham, codicil dated the 16th of June, 1718, & proved the 10th of Nov., 1718.  Mentioned are his "eldest son" John, son Edmond, "youngest son" Nathaniel, dau. Mary Knowles, da
3 CONC u. Hannah Mayo & her husband John Mayo (called son), Patience Paine & her husband/brother in law?, John Paine (called son), dau. Rebecca Freeman, "widow of Thomas Freeman", multiple grandchildren & two slaves, Toby & Bess, who are to be freed, hav
3 CONC e 5 acres of land & who are to be looked after by his children, "into such a way as they may not want."
