2 PAGE There is no accompanying proof to this information - it could have just as well been submitted to the society by someone here in the US that perpetuates the unproved idea that William Cash was from Scotland.  No proof documents of his birth, or tha
3 CONC t any child of his name born in Scotland emigrated to the colonies, is provided.  Assumption of a birth across the pond must be accompanied by proof that child survived childhood and actually departed from Scotland.  Otherwise it is just one more a
3 CONC ssumption.  He was in America with first wife Rebeckah, who isn't mentioned, before he married Elizabeth Skinner - she certainly was not from Fife.
