2 PAGE (Thomas Foster born 1599/1600 married Elizabeth ______ , born about 1618, whose maiden name is still unknown, in about 1639 at Weymouth, Norfolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony): 
3 CONT Thomas Foster held the office of deacon [in the Church].  No record is found of his marriage; [no colonial marriage records exist before 1640, and Thomas Foster appears to have married in 1639.]; but in March 1648 and in November 1679, he had a wif
3 CONC e Elizabeth, probably the same who is provided for by his will, dated April 18, 1682, and probably also the mother of all his children.  He died April 20, 1682.
