0 @N107@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT From Find a Grave  
1 CONT Hiram married Mercy (Wyatt) Rundell, both being natives of New York, and of English and French descent. They were married in New York, whence they moved to a farm in Richland County, Ohio, and lived until 1842. Then they came to Indiana. They enter
1 CONC ed eighty acres of land in Green Township, Morgan County, which they continued to improve for several years. In 1850, they removed to a farm near Morgantown, where, in November of the same year, Hiram died.
