0 @N294@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Timothy Edge was born in December 1737 in Tipton, Staffordshire, England, when his father, Richard, was 34 and his mother, Sarah, was 37. 
1 CONT He married three times and had 12 children, seven sons and five daughters. He lived most of his married life in Bloxwich, Staffordshire, and died and was buried there in June 1823, at 85 years of age.
