1 CONT 
1 CONT Daughter Lydia and her husband James Foster.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Son-in-law Chillingsworth Foster who had been married to his daughter, Mercy, and their five children (names not listed).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Deceased daughter Thankful's children: Edward, Parnel, Thankful and Zerviah Hammond. Also, son-in-law Josephus Hammond.
