0 @N1147@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT John and Mary Sharp Parks' Children:
1 CONT 1. RACHEL Parks, born Dec. 3, 1733, in VA or Wilkes Co.; married Jonathan Stamper; died in Wilkes County, NC, after 1800. 
1 CONT 2. ELIZABETH "Betsy" Parks, born Feb. 27, 1734, in VA; married ___ Gray and lived and died in Wilkes County, NC. 
1 CONT 3. MARY Parks, born Jan. 4, 1736, in VA; married __ Carrell and lived and died in Wilkes County, NC. 
1 CONT 4. WILLIAM Parks, born Oct. 13, 1737, in Amherst Co., VA; married Tabitha Ware first and Mary Ann Dawson second.
1 CONT 5. JOHN Parks II, born Mar. 6, 1739, in VA or Burke Co., NC.; died in 1784 (or 1798?) in Wilkes County, NC; married to Ann Toney. 
1 CONT 6. THOMAS Parks, born Nov. 29, 1740, in VA or Burke Co., NC.; died in Burke Co., NC.; married Rachel White.
1 CONT 7. ANN Parks, born Sept. 15, 1742, in VA. 
1 CONT 8. WINDFIELD Parks, born Mar. 24, 1744, in VA. He was Mildred's twin. 
1 CONT 9. MILDRED Parks, born Mar. 24, 1744 in VA. She was Windfield's twin. 
1 CONT 10. BENJAMIN Parks I, born Mar. 25, 1746, in King George County, VA; first married Virlinche Branche; second marriage was to Elizabeth Branch.
1 CONT 11. FRANCIS "Franky" Parks, born Dec. 28, 1747, in VA; married ___ Mays and lived and died in VA. 
1 CONT 12. CHARLES Parks, born Oct. 13, 1749, in VA and died in GA; married Mary Salmons first and Sarah ___ second; died Nov. 2, 1806, in Elbert Co., GA. 
1 CONT 13. SUSANNA Parks, born Sept. 22, 1751, and lived in Wilkes County, NC; married William Garrell. 
1 CONT 14. LINCHFIELD Parks, born Feb. 14, 1753 in VA and died in NC. 
1 CONT 15. SARAH Parks "Sally," born Mar. 22, 1755, in VA; married Cornelius Sale; lived and died in Wilkes County, NC. 
1 CONT 16. SAMUEL Lined Parks, born Nov. 28, 1757, in Amherst, VA; married Elizabeth Harbison; died Oct. 23, 1844, in Burke County, NC. 
1 CONT 17. GEORGE Parks, born Aug. 5, 1759, in VA; lived in Surry, Wilkes, and Burke Counties in NC and Monroe County, Indiana; married Millicent Davis first and Catherine Reed second.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Source: "Genealogy of The Parks and Related Families," by James Edgar and Barbara Carton Parks, (2002)
1 CONT 
1 CONT Two land deeds:
1 CONT John Parks, Sr. of Amherst County, 7 September 1767; 6 January 1768, John Parks, Senr. settles a bond of 100 pounds to George Kipper and Company, Store in Albermarle County [Virginia]; and "the said John Parks hath sold 390 acres in Amherst County
1 CONC , the same land he purchased of Pierce Wace & Deed recorded to him in Albermarle County...."
1 CONT 
1 CONT John Parks and Mary his wife of Amherst County, sell to Will Campbell of Albermarle County for 110 pounds, 399 acres....Signed, John Parks, Mary Parks.
