0 @N1150@ NOTE To all People to whom these Presents shall come I John Parks Senior of the Parish of and County of Surry Planter for and in consideration of the Love goodwilll and affections which I have and do bear to my children one and all I freely giv
1 CONC e grant and granted and by these presents do freely give, grant unto my children their Heirs Executors Administrators all and singular my Estate of
1 CONT Land, Negroes, and all ......of stock. And the yearly increase of the Earth; all ... and ..... together with all other House Furniture and it shall be lawful at whatsoever time that all and every of my Children  will be jointly and severally agree
1 CONC s to sell the said goods and chattels aforesaid for money and divide it among them all which shall be done at the discretion of William Parks and John Parks my two eldest sons as follows, they shall deliver to my Daughter Sally Sale one Negroe Bo
1 CONC y named Goin in consideration of taking care of two helpless children and the said Sally Sale to take them into her care with their Equal Portions and his.. one the said Sally Sale and her Heirs and the said William and John Parks to pay off all th
1 CONC e rest their equal parts of what there is to them their heirs and to be allowed said ...full reward for their trouble without any manner of Condition in Witness whereof have ... my and land and seal this twenty eight day of
1 CONT September one thousand seven hundred and seventy two.
