1 CONT Thomas (Parkes) Parks Sr. was a Virginia colonist.
1 CONT Thomas Parkes was born about 1678 in Old Rappahanock, Virginia. He married Sara Miller in 1705 in Albemarle County, Virginia. He died 12 March 1761 in Ballengers Mountain, Albemarle, Virginia.
1 CONT 
