1 CONC " edited by William Armstrong Crozier. Remarks The Honble. Alexander Spotswood, Esqr., by John Grame, Gent., his attorney, to Thomas Parks of St. Geo. Par. Spts. Co., in consideration of so much tobacco, etc. 100 a. of land i fork of Rappa. River
