1 CONT ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
1 CONT NOTE: It has been proved conclusively that the first wife of Angel Husted was not "Rebecca Sherwood".
1 CONT For information on the second wife of Angel Husted, whose first name was Rebecca, please refer to "Rebecca Revisited: The Unidentified Wives of Angell Huested and Jonathan Reynolds of Greenwich, Connecticut" by Gordon Remington (The American Geneal
1 CONC ogist, vol. 73, July 1998, pp. 201-206).
