1 CONT p. 531 in 1640, John Allin requests permission for widow Elizabeth to sell half of her 12 acre lot for the support of her two young children, her husband having died intestate.  In his 1671 will, Rev. Allen named kinsmen Samuell, Thomas, and Rober
1 CONC t Fisher.
