1 CONT "Joanathan, son of John Reynolds and Sarah ----, born at Weathersfield, Conn, in 1636; died in Greenwich, Conn, in 1673; married Rebecca Husted, daughter of Angell Husted, 1658. (This has been proven false by later research. Jonathan's Will was pro
1 CONC bated in Jan 1673 listing his daughter, Rebecca, as being 17 years old - born in 1656. Rebecca Husted's birth has been documented as 1645. She would have been 10 or 11 years old when Rebecca was conceived.  The last name of the Rebecca that marrie
1 CONC d both Jonathan Reynolds and Angell Husted is unknown.)  The children of Jonathan and Rebecca Reynolds were:
