1 CONT For Robert Jr.'s children, they are listed below from his family records. This Robert Coles, Jr. moved to the Oysterbay area, New York, by about 1661.  For BIRTH FAMILY for Robert Coles, (2) or Jr., see latest scholarship in Robert Charles Anderson
1 CONC , "Great Migration Begins," vol. 1, A-F, page 435-438.  Robert Coles, Jr. was son by the second wife.
1 CONT By his first wife Mary Robert Coles (1) had John, b. about 1630; Deliverance, b. say 1632; Ann b. say, 1634.  
1 CONT By Mary Hawxhurst, he had Daniel, b. say 1637; Nathaniel, b. 1642; Robert, b. say 1644; and Sarah, b. say 1646.  These are the family members that can be proved by primary source records.
1 CONT AM AT WORK TO CORRECT THIS RECORD and his wives and children as per:  Robert Charles Anderson, 435-438.
