1 CONC sh of Abington of the county of Gloucester plant, a parcell of land containing four hundred and forty acres lying on the north side of Rappa River and adjoining to the land of Mr Cornelius Reynolds...
1 CONT ... and further I the sd SYMON MILLER & MARGARET MILLER MY WIFE do warrant the sale of the said land...
