1 CONT 1. UFFORD, Uffoot, Thomas, came from England to America in 1632, with his wife Isabel and three children, in the ship Lion; landed at Boston, where he was made freeman that same year.  He was in Milford as early as January, 1645-6, where he and hi
1 CONC s wife Isabel joined the church in that place.  He died in Stratford in 1660, leaving an estate of £289-12-7.
1 CONT 2. Thomas, b. in England. +
1 CONT 3. John, b. in England. +
1 CONT 4. Daughter, b. in England; m. Roger Terrell.
