0 @N2753@ NOTE Edmond Freeman + Wives: Bennett Hodsoll & Elizabeth (Unknown),  Family Data in sketch about Edmond Freeman in outstanding historical series, "The Great Migration....,"  by Robert Charles Anderson, George F. Sanborn, Jr., & Melinde Lutz Sanb
