1 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Parks-7539
1 CONT John Ambrose "of Virginia" Parks
1 CONT Born 27 Mar 1642 in Saint Clement, Cornwall, Englandmap
1 CONT Son of Thomas Parks and Katherne (Miller) Parks
1 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
1 CONT Husband of Fannie (Battle) Parks — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
1 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
1 CONT Father of Thomas (Parkes) Parks Sr.
1 CONT Died about 1679 in Virginia
1 CONT 
1 CONT Biography
1 CONT 
1 CONT John Parks was christened 27 Mar 1642 at Saint Clement, Cornwall, England.
1 CONT Child of John Parks
