1 CONC e Co in a Spotsylvania deed.  John remained in Spotsylvania Co and a son John "Junr" is named in a deed there in 1742.  There are numerous Proctors present after that date to include a Thomas who purchased land in 1775 - too early to be the Thoma
1 CONC s who was later in Logan Co KY.  There is a Charles who signed several of the legal documents of the Haydon family and is likely the same as the one who left a will in Spotsylvania in the mid 1780's - he mentioned a William Proctor, son of a Thoma
