0 @N3096@ NOTE Records of William Cash from the Westmoreland County DEEDS, PATENTS, WILLS, ETC. 1665-1677 list him as a debtor in 1674.  See copies of this in his document section below. Digitized Microfilm 7645852, Frame #473-484.  William's name is foun
1 CONC d on Frame 478 at the bottom left page and Frame 482 at the top left hand page. Frame # 473 shows the date at the top of the left page.
0 @N3097@ NOTE There is no date of his death!  Died between these dates: 16 Feb. 1707 will was written and 25 Aug. 1708 probate record.
