0 @N3105@ NOTE record number
0 @N3106@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT This is Sara, wife of Thomas Looke
1 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LBHM-ZND
1 CONT 
1 CONT Please stop merging her with Sarah Millard. They are not identical.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sara's death is recorded in the "Book of Essex County Birth, Marriages and Deaths".  Children of Thomas Looke's birth is near the top of the same page.  Mother's name is not recorded with the births.  It should be noted that Mary was crossed out an
1 CONC d replaced with Sara on the line recording her death.   
1 CONT 
1 CONT Miller is her possible maiden name.  This comes from an attached Nantucket source, presumably the birth record of son, Thomas.  Thomas, who was born in Essex, was living in Nantucket by 1669.  Without looking at the actual Nantucket document, it i
1 CONC s not possible to know if it is a birth record.  It could just as likely be a record that contains information on his birth year and parents names.
1 CONT 
1 CONT The birthplace and origins of Thomas Looke of Lynn and his wife are not known. For a good summary of the family please read:
1 CONT 
1 CONT Walter Goodwin Davis, Massachusetts and Maine Families in the Ancestry of Walter Goodwin Davis (Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Co., 1996) II:487-91
1 CONT 
1 CONT Available on Ancestry.com
