0 @N3170@ NOTE His will dated Feb. 16, 1679 is filed at the Essex County, Court House.
1 CONT It was proved in Rappahannock County, , Virginia May 2, 1684
1 CONT 
1 CONT Historical Southern Families Vol XIX, pp 97 - 107
1 CONT 
