1 CONT Know all men by these presents that I, Simon Miller, of the County of Rappak., doe constitute & appoint my true & loving friend, Adam Wofendale, to be my true and lawfull attorney for me & in my ____ & to acknowledge a small parcell of land unto Th
1 CONC omas Arnold of the same county & what my said attorney shall act & doe in the ____, shall stand in ull force & virtue, as if I my selfe were originally present.
1 CONT 
1 CONT As witness, my hand and seale this 24th of January 1679.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Simon Miller
