0 @N3224@ NOTE Thomas Newman
1 CONT BIRTH	1584
1 CONT Oakley, Bedford Borough, Bedfordshire, England
1 CONT DEATH	1660 (aged 75–76)
1 CONT Westchester Square, Bronx County, New York, USA
