1 CONT v SARAH, b. say 1638; on 30 September 1656 "Hackaliah Bridges, ·accused by Sarah French of his getting her with child, and bound over, being brought by Sergeant French, was discharged" [EQC 2:2]; if she was a daughter of Thomas French, she had app
