0 @N3264@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT The origins of Mrs. Mary Worden are unknown. She was not "Mary Magdalen Winslow", and there is no record of Mrs. Worden having a middle name. There has been incorrect information that she was the sister of Edward Winslow, and sadly this misinformat
1 CONC ion has been widely copied. Edward Winslow had a sister Magdalen, but she remained in England and married a William Wake, NOT Peter Worden. There is no record of a sister named Mary.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Mayflower Families are VERY well documented. She is not a Winslow!!!THERE IS NO CURRENT EVIDENCE OF A SURNAME FOR MARY!!! Peter is buried in the Worden Burying Ground, which is known as the Winslow-Homer Cemetery. It was his daughter who marrie
1 CONC d a Winslow. He's buried in his son-in-law's Cemetery, not his wife's.
