1 CONT This lady had virtures and culture which entitled her to more than a passing notice.  A gentlewoman of remarkable sobriety and piety, given also to hospitality.  She was the only midwife and doctress on the Island, or rather a doctor, all her days
1 CONC , with very little, and with some and mostly, not reward at all.  Her skill in surgery was doubtless very great and could heal people with gun shot wounds, lightning strikes and bites from venomous poison rattlesnakes.  See History of Block Island,
1 CONC , pg. 281.  
1 CONT 
